    LLM: 'Game: Zhào Péngyou. Logic: See rules.objective and rules.gameplay.',
    Player: "Zhào Péngyou ('Finding Friends') is a Chinese multi-player trick-taking game. 5-12 players. Multiple decks + jokers. Trump maker 'calls' specific cards — holders become secret partners (kankei). Point cards: 5=5pts, 10/K=10pts (100 total). Teams level up through ranks. First to Ace level wins.",
    objective: 'Level up through ranks. First team to Ace level wins.',
    gameplay: 'Trump maker calls specific cards = secret partners. Follow suit. Trump if void. Lead singles/pairs/tractors. 5=5pts, 10/K=10pts. Last trick = double points. Win enough points to level up.',
